Log the cause when Library Management cannot read a file at preview.

Why: the dry run of 2026-10-24 blocked 10 files as FILE_UNREADABLE, but the
path and read step of the planner maps the error to that reason without
logging it, unlike the tag steps next to it ("tags unreadable at preview").
The files read back whole afterwards (sha256 over all 10), so the cause was
transient or a path check, and nothing recorded which. The step now logs the
error at INFO, as its neighbours do.

Tests: none (a log line); cargo check -p droppedneedle-library.

Remove when: upstream logs it.

